          "timestamp": 214
        },
        {
          "text": "Your thumbs should be touching your hands",
          "timestamp": 223
        },
        {
          "text": "Do not straighten the thumbs",
          "timestamp": 227
        },
        {
          "text": "Do not raise the elbows; your elbows should not rise when your hands are raised",
          "timestamp": 230
        },
        {
          "text": "The palms of your hands should not be visible when seen from the front",
